              "2SA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.16.5+2SA.16.6+2SA.16.7+2SA.16.8+2SA.16.9+2SA.16.10+2SA.16.11+2SA.16.12+2SA.16.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Cam 16.5-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cimei wod pa Gera, ma jo ‘Benjamin, dano me Bakurim, en bene orune obino kacel ki jo Juda ka jolo kabaka Daudi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kun bino ki jo” Benjamin ma romo alip acel. Ki Jiba “ma, latic ma loyo ot pa Caulo, ki awo bene apar wiye abic, ki luticce pyeraryo, gin bene gucorre i kulu Jordan ci gutuc i nyim kabaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gukato ki i waŋ wat pi kelo dano pa kabaka loka kulu, ki pi tiyo gin ducu ma kabaka mito,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Cimei wod pa Gera obino, ci opoto piny i nyim kabaka i kare ma kabaka doŋ mito ŋolo Jordan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owaco bot kabakani, “Kabaka, pe imak balla i cwinyi, pe ibed ka po i kom gin ma yam atimo i komi marac, laditta kabaka, i kare ma ia kwede i Jerucalem. Pe iket lokke i cwinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An laticci aŋeyo maber ni atimo bak Pienno, nen an doŋ tin abino, dok an aye akwoŋo bino ki i kin dano me ot pa Yucepu ka joli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abicai wod pa Jefuya ogamo ni, “Pe gibineko Cimei woko pi lok mari, pien yam obedo ka ceno dano ma Rwot owiro?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Daudi ogamo ni, “Gin aŋo ma alaro kwedwu, wun awobe pa Jeruya, ma wun bene tin wulokke wudoko lumerokka? Tin dok gibineko dano i kin jo Icrael? Tin aye doŋ aniaŋ atir ni, an kabaka ma loyo jo Icrael.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka dok owacci, “In Cimei pe ibito.” Ci okwoŋŋe kwoŋ lamok lokke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
